{"exhaustive":{"nbHits":false,"typo":false},"exhaustiveNbHits":false,"exhaustiveTypo":false,"hits":[{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"marojejian"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["pdf"],"value":"When Does Automating AI Research Produce Explosive Growth? [<em>pdf</em>]"},"url":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["pdf"],"value":"https://basilhalperin.com/papers/singularities.<em>pdf</em>"}},"_tags":["story","author_marojejian","story_49948355"],"author":"marojejian","children":[49948356],"created_at":"2026-10-03T22:22:10Z","created_at_i":1791066130,"num_comments":1,"objectID":"49948355","points":1,"story_id":49948355,"title":"When Does Automating AI Research Produce Explosive Growth? [pdf]","updated_at":"2026-10-03T22:26:23Z","url":"https://basilhalperin.com/papers/singularities.pdf"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"spkaikai"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["pdf"],"value":"Hi there.<p>I used to work in international trade, and encountered many situations where people create a <em>PDF</em> from a system, send it to another party, and the other party parses the <em>PDF</em> to input into their system.<p>As AI agents become first principles to deal with the documents, I believe the extra document creation and parsing step will become unnecessary.<p>So I created a JSON viewer, where you can sign JSON and send it to other parties as a portable document. It can also display JSON data in a more document-like format.<p>I\u2019m wondering if such a format can be used as a replacement for some document communication today. I'd be so happy to hear your thoughts."},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: [Open-source] Sign JSON and send it as a business document"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://json-doc.com/"}},"_tags":["story","a